# A bare free name takes the caller's binding first (dynamic), `node\x` the field of the space above the method (the
# book, ~977; plan M11 5b part 2): probe called by caller reads the bare x 25 and `node\x` 10 -- 2510.
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: r 0
)
@: shared data[0]
int: x 10
fn: probe () int
    return: x * 100 + node\x
fn: caller () int
    int: x 25
    return: probe()
int: r caller()

sub: main ()
    shared\Observed\r := r
main()
